            <div class="shrink-0 w-9 h-9 mt-0.5 bg-white rounded-md flex items-center justify-center text-red-600 shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(255,255,255,0.25)]">
              <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3.5" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-white"><span class="text-white font-semibold">Outdated digital storefront?</span> A clunky, slow website makes it harder for customers to trust your brand before they even reach out.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <Image src={ash2} alt="Western NC business district" class="rounded-2xl shadow-2xl aspect-square object-cover" />
        <Image src={ash7} alt="Local results in Western NC" class="rounded-2xl shadow-2xl aspect-square object-cover mt-8" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Web Design Services -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <p class="text-brand-cyan text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">✦ Web Design Western NC</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Custom Strategies for <span class="text-brand-cyan">Western NC Businesses</span></h2>
        <p class="text-white max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg">
          From brand-new launches to full redesigns, our Western NC web design process is built around one outcome: websites that rank, convert, and keep working.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-16">
        <div class="relative group bg-brand-dark p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/40 transition-colors">
          <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 w-9 h-9 bg-brand-accent rounded-full flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(132,204,22,0.5)]">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-5 h-5 text-[#1c1c1c]">
              <path class="check-draw" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Modern, High-Converting Website Design in Western NC</h3>
          <p class="text-white leading-relaxed">We design streamlined, fast-loading websites for Western NC businesses that elevate your brand's perceived value from the first click. Every layout is mobile-responsive and optimized for the way mountain customers actually browse — often from their phones.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="relative group bg-brand-dark p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/40 transition-colors">
          <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 w-9 h-9 bg-brand-accent rounded-full flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(132,204,22,0.5)]">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-5 h-5 text-[#1c1c1c]">
              <path class="check-draw" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">SEO-First Foundation</h3>
          <p class="text-white leading-relaxed">Your site is built on a clean, crawlable technical foundation from day one — fast core web vitals, proper schema, and keyword-mapped pages. That's how "web design Asheville NC" and "web design Hendersonville" searches convert into ranked pages, not just pretty graphics.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="relative group bg-brand-dark p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/40 transition-colors">
          <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 w-9 h-9 bg-brand-accent rounded-full flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(132,204,22,0.5)]">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-5 h-5 text-[#1c1c1c]">
              <path class="check-draw" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Local SEO That Puts You on the Map</h3>
          <p class="text-white leading-relaxed">We align your Google Business Profile, directories, and citations so you win the local map pack for "seo company asheville", "hendersonville seo", and "waynesville seo company" style searches — the visible, local-intent traffic that actually books appointments.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="relative group bg-brand-dark p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/40 transition-colors">
          <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 w-9 h-9 bg-brand-accent rounded-full flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(132,204,22,0.5)]">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-5 h-5 text-[#1c1c1c]">
              <path class="check-draw" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Ongoing Partnerships, Not Throwaway Projects</h3>
          <p class="text-white leading-relaxed">As Western NC's digital landscape evolves, we continually refine your site and campaigns to keep your operations scaling — long-term partners for sustainable, compounding growth.</p>
        </div>
