        <a href="/services/web-design/" class="cta-glow-shine inline-block bg-gradient-to-b from-[#a3e635] via-brand-accent to-[#65a30d] text-black px-8 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold border border-white/20 shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.65),inset_0_-2px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25),0_4px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4),0_2px_8px_rgba(132,204,22,0.35),0_0_20px_rgba(132,204,22,0.25)] hover:from-[#b5f146] hover:via-brand-accent-light hover:to-[#4d7c0f] hover:-translate-y-[1px] active:translate-y-[1px] active:shadow-[inset_0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3),0_2px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] transition-all duration-300">Explore our full web design services →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SEO Services -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-brand-darkest border-y border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <p class="text-brand-cyan text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">✦ Western NC SEO</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Western NC SEO Services That Rank on <span class="text-brand-blue">Page One</span></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
        <p class="text-white leading-relaxed text-lg">
          Ranking on page one for "asheville seo", "hendersonville seo", and "waynesville seo" searches means showing up where buyers already are. Shelby Web Company is a Western NC SEO company focused on one result: putting your business in front of local customers at the exact moment they're ready to buy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-16">
        <div class="relative group bg-brand-dark p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-blue/40 transition-colors">
          <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 w-9 h-9 bg-brand-accent rounded-full flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(132,204,22,0.5)]">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-5 h-5 text-[#1c1c1c]">
              <path class="check-draw" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Local SEO & Map Pack Dominance</h3>
          <p class="text-white leading-relaxed">We optimize your Google Business Profile, local citations, and on-page signals so your business wins the Western NC map pack — the visible, high-intent slot locals actually click.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="relative group bg-brand-dark p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-blue/40 transition-colors">
          <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 w-9 h-9 bg-brand-accent rounded-full flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(132,204,22,0.5)]">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-5 h-5 text-[#1c1c1c]">
              <path class="check-draw" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Content & Keyword Strategy</h3>
          <p class="text-white leading-relaxed">We map every keyword from "asheville web design" to "seo company hendersonville nc" onto pages built to rank — then create content that answers exactly what Western NC searchers ask.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="relative group bg-brand-dark p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-blue/40 transition-colors">
          <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 w-9 h-9 bg-brand-accent rounded-full flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(132,204,22,0.5)]">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-5 h-5 text-[#1c1c1c]">
              <path class="check-draw" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Technical SEO & Site Speed</h3>
          <p class="text-white leading-relaxed">Fast core web vitals, clean schema, crawlable architecture. Your Western NC site loads in a blink and Google can read every page — the foundation every ranking needs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="relative group bg-brand-dark p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-blue/40 transition-colors">
          <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 w-9 h-9 bg-brand-accent rounded-full flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(132,204,22,0.5)]">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-5 h-5 text-[#1c1c1c]">
              <path class="check-draw" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Conversion-Focused Optimization</h3>
          <p class="text-white leading-relaxed">Ranking is only step one. We optimize every page to turn Western NC searchers into calls, form fills, and booked appointments.</p>
        </div>
